ow-up cites the existing visited-set monotonicity theorem and clarifies two sketch sentences.\n\nValidation so far: fresh Lean 4.25 owner-module check passes with zero errors and zero sorry warnings, using a complete copied snapshot and the throttled four-thread wrapper. Full 229-module replay, complete compiled axiom accounting, scoped opacity controls, expanded source comparison and external audit remain pending. Records: `campaign/fills/f6/landing/`.\n\n**Not yet clear to merge: validation and audit remain open.**\n","created_at":"2026-11-08T01:01:05Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T01:01:05Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/pulls/235/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/pulls/235/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/issues/235/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/statuses/f72a807e2376a2b986675c992745d6affc23b96f","head":{"label":"Shilun-Allan-Li:codex/f6-space-universal","ref":"codex/f6-space-universal","sha":"f72a807e2376a2b986675c992745d6affc23b96f","user":{"login":"Shilun-Allan-Li","id":47707803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzA3ODAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47707803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shilun-Allan-Li","html_url":"https://github.com/Shilun-Allan-Li","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shilun-Allan-Li/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shilun-Allan-Li/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shilun-Allan-Li/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shilun-Allan-Li/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: